# Play test of The Trade Wind Archipelago (CIPlay trade_wind_archipelago, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its
# recipe ("offset"). Port Alize on the main island's south shore (the quay at 1 m along z 11, the office -54.5..-44 x
# 19.5..30, the harbour dug to 6 m at -45 1); the committee boat at -40 -22; the buoys at 15 25, 50 90, 75 145, 155 75,
# 155 25, the wreck 25 -115 (8 m down), -150 20, -88 -2; Windward Cay's boardwalk at 78..93 x 138.5..140 (deck 2.1 m), the
# fish market 103.5..114 x 134.5..145; Leeward Key's landing at -103 -35, the pen at -126..-117 x -39..-31 (5 m); the
# clubhouse -43.5..-33 x 55.5..66 (11 m), the bell tower's deck at -38 52 (12 m up).
island The Trade Wind Archipelago
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Trade Wind Regatta
wait 5
expect animals Chicken 3
expect animals Goat 3
at -45 14 h=3
zone portalize
expect step 1
read The regatta notice
expect step 2
at -40 -22 h=2
use startcannon
expect message Sign on
at -49 24.8 h=3.5
use register
expect story racenumber 1
expect step 3
at -45 3 h=-4.5
zone harbourfloor
expect step 4
open Harbourmaster's tiller box
expect story pennant 1
expect step 6
at -40 -22 h=2
zone startline
expect step 6
use startcannon
expect shown buoy1
at 15 25 h=0.5
zone buoy1
expect step 7
at 50 90 h=0.5
zone buoy2
expect step 8
at 75 145 h=0.5
zone buoy3
expect step 9
at 88 139.2 h=3.5
zone windwardcay
expect step 10
read The fishwife's complaint
expect step 11
open Windward Cay's pennant box
expect message FOR WHOEVER CLEARS
at 107 140 h=3.5
zone fishmarket
kill Rat
expect step 12
open Windward Cay's pennant box
expect story pennant 2
expect step 13
at 155 75 h=0.5
zone buoy4
expect step 14
at 155 25 h=0.5
zone buoy5
expect step 15
expect shown wreckmark
at 25 -115 h=0.5
zone wreckmark
expect step 16
at 28 -111 h=-6.5
use wreckflag
expect story leaderflag 1
expect step 17
at -103 -35 h=3
zone leewardkey
expect step 18
read The goatherd's plea
expect step 19
open Goatherd's basket
catch Goat 3
expect step 20
open Leeward Key's pennant box
expect story pennant 3
expect step 21
at -150 20 h=0.5
zone buoy7
expect step 22
at -88 -2 h=0.5
zone buoy8
expect step 23
expect shown finish
at -40 -22 h=2
zone finish
expect step 24
read The committee's ledger
expect step 25
use entrybox
expect story entryslip 1
expect step 26
at -36 59 h=12.5
zone clubhouse
expect step 27
at -38.4 52 h=14
zone clubtower
expect step 28
use winnersbell
expect shown celebration
expect shown engraving
read The trophy's engraving
expect step 29
open The Trade Wind Trophy
expect done
open Fruit stall box
open Committee boat box
open Windward barrel
open Wreck's crate
open Islet box
